schema/stac-osd.json:5:  "description": "Collection fields state what our tools established about the whole record (record-level assurance, not per file or per feature). Item fields state how one feature's geometry was obtained. Enums are closed and no other osd: field is allowed. Offline validation maps this URL to schema/stac-osd.json (schema/stac/schema-map.json). v2 (E19): `osd:access` admits `purchase`; the identifier gains `?v=2`. The v1 identifier resolves to this same file online, so a document naming either identifier validates here; v1 is frozen at tests/fixtures/schema/stac-osd-1.json. v3 (E18): Items gain `osd:period_source`; the identifier gains `?v=3`; a document naming the v1 or v2 identifier validates here too; v2 is frozen at tests/fixtures/schema/stac-osd-2.json.",
schema/stac-osd.json:38:          "contains": {"enum": ["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ophiolite-labs/open-subsurface-data/main/schema/stac-osd.json?v=3", "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ophiolite-labs/open-subsurface-data/main/schema/stac-osd.json?v=2", "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ophiolite-labs/open-subsurface-data/main/schema/stac-osd.json"]}
